<title>UK: TABLE-Berkerley year profits rise 73 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Berkerley year profits rise 73 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		51.4		   vs 34.8</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  7.0		   vs 6.2</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  9.5		   vs 8.4</p>
<p> Pretax		     75.1		   vs 43.4</p>
<p> Turnover		   485		    vs 334</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 57.5 and 68.4 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Berkeley Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
